------ Cloud workbench ------

Repos under ~/workspace, then start Herdr:

  cd ~/workspace/<your-repo>
  start-herdr [claude|codex|opencode|cursor]

Default agent is claude. Example:

  start-herdr
  start-herdr cursor
  start-herdr codex ~/workspace/other-repo

GitHub and npm helpers (prefer these in agent sessions):

  gh-axi ...
  npm-axi ...

Clone a repo (HTTPS only — the box mints tokens for you):

  git clone https://github.com/<owner>/<repo>.git ~/workspace/<repo>
